Spotify Soloist is not included. It is Spotify's software under Spotify's
terms; the plugin downloads it from Spotify on the speaker, together with
its THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.

Bundled runtime (built by build-runtime.sh from Debian 13 packages):
- GNU C Library 2.41 (libc6): LGPL-2.1-or-later, see licenses/runtime/libc6-copyright.
  Source: https://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/g/glibc/
- libatomic1 and libgcc-s1 from GCC 14: GPL-3.0-or-later with the GCC Runtime
  Library Exception, see licenses/runtime/gcc-14-base-copyright.
  Source: https://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/g/gcc-14/
- Mozilla CA certificates (ca-certificates): MPL-2.0, see licenses/runtime/ca-certificates-copyright.
- libpulse.so.0 in the runtime is not PulseAudio: it is this plugin's own shim
  (pulse-shim/pulse.c, MIT, as above).
Go runtime: BSD-style license (licenses/go-LICENSE).
